  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "session": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**`as`:** Binds the exact approved program source and emits nothing. Omitted, that source is emitted where the component is written.

