### `<SafeParse>`

Parse a value using a JSON schema. `<SafeParse schema={plan} as="plan">…</SafeParse>` parses its content. Binds a result object instead of erroring.

**Forms:** `<SafeParse />`, `<SafeParse>…</SafeParse>`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `schema` | JSON Schema | yes |  |

```json
