Scope a workflow-hosted execution. `<WorkflowRun>…</WorkflowRun>` holds `<Execution host="workflow">` children, and refuses unless the host supplies a workflow profile.

**Forms:** `<WorkflowRun />`, `<WorkflowRun>…</WorkflowRun>`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `string` | no |  |

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**Body context:** The workflow-hosted executions this scope owns.

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/testing` (registered default)

### `<Worktree>`

Create or use a worktree. `<Worktree name="review" branch="issue-643">…</Worktree>` expands its content in the worktree.

**Forms:** `<Worktree />`, `<Worktree>…</Worktree>`

#### Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `name` | `string` | yes |  |
| `branch` | `string` | yes |  |
| `base` | `string` | no |  |

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "branch": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "base": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name",
    "branch"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

**`as`:** Optional. The path of the linked checkout.

**Body context:** The Markdown expanded in that checkout.

**Returns:** text — the markdown this component renders.

```json
{
  "type": "string"
}
```

**Origin:** `@executablemd/workflow/composition` (registered default)

