Arguments:
   [path]                    markdown document to execute, optionally `#` and one target selector; `xmd run -` reads the document from standard input instead

Options:
   -e, --eval [EVAL]         inline markdown document to execute, in place of a path
   --include <INCLUDE>...    component search directory [default: components,.]
   -V, --verbose             log journal entries to stderr [default: false]
   -j, --journal [JOURNAL]   write a diagnostic JSONL trace (path must not exist)
   --raw                     output raw markdown without normalization or terminal formatting [default: false]
   --agent-provider <AGENTPROVIDER> agent provider for agent components [default: acpx]
   --default-agent [DEFAULTAGENT] default agent name (overrides DEFAULT_AGENT_NAME)
   --approve-all             approve every agent permission request [default: false]
   --approve-reads           approve read and search agent permissions, ask for the rest (default) [default: false]
   --deny-all                deny every agent permission request [default: false]
   --timeout [TIMEOUT]       deadline for the whole run, as a duration (500ms, 30s, 5min)
   --timeout-exec [TIMEOUTEXEC] default timeout for each exec block, as a duration (500ms, 30s, 5min)
   --timeout-fetch [TIMEOUTFETCH] default timeout for each fetch, as a duration (500ms, 30s, 5min)
