          },
          "description": "Set the agent for every prompt in its content. `<Agent name=\"codex\">…</Agent>` reaches prompts sent from nested components too. `<Agent name=\"codex\" />` checks the agent is available.",
          "context": "Markdown whose prompts and launches use this agent."
