          "description": "Set the agent provider for its content. `<AgentProvider name=\"acpx\">…</AgentProvider>` applies to everything inside, where `defaultAgent` sets the agent to use when none is named and `timeout` bounds each prompt. An unknown provider fails before the content runs.",
          "context": "Markdown expanded with this provider installed."
