### `<CollectJournal>`

Capture a child execution's journal so a test can assert on it. `<CollectJournal as="journal" />` goes inside `<Execution>`, beside `<CollectOutput>`. It reads a journal the run already has — pair it with `<DiagnosticJournal>` to create one.

**Forms:** `<CollectJournal />`, `<CollectJournal>…</CollectJournal>`

